.TH DENTISYS-TOOLKIT 8 "2026" "Group 07" "DentiSYS Administration"
.nh
.SH NAME
dentisys-toolkit \- scripts for installing and running dentisys
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dentisys-install.sh
[\-\-port PORT] [\-\-mail\-port PORT] BUNDLE
.br
.B dentisys-service.sh
start | stop | restart
.br
.B dentisys-status.sh
.br
.B dentisys-update.sh
BUNDLE
.PP
More commands are planned, see the NOTES section at the end.
.SH DESCRIPTION
DentiSYS is our capstone system for grades, attendance and accounts. On the
server it runs as five docker containers: db (postgres), mailpit (test mail),
biometric (face recognition), web (php backend) and frontend (nginx).
.PP
The scripts only need root and the paths are in one shared file,
.BR dentisys-lib.sh .
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B dentisys-install.sh \fR[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIBUNDLE
Installs from a bundle made by dentisys-bundle.sh. Installs docker with apt,
makes the dentisys service user, unpacks the files to /opt/dentisys, loads the
images, writes /etc/dentisys/dentisys.env with random passwords, then starts
the stack and checks that the page answers.
.PP
Options:
.B \-\-port
(app port, default 8080),
.B \-\-mail\-port
(mailpit port, default 8025).
.TP
.B dentisys-service.sh start\fR|\fBstop\fR|\fBrestart
.B start
brings the containers up one at a time in the order db, mailpit, biometric, web,
frontend, because web dies if the db is not ready.
.B stop
is the same list backwards.
.B restart
is stop then start.
.TP
.B dentisys-status.sh
One report: version, container states, the port, whether the page answers, and
docker stats. Changes nothing.
.TP
.B dentisys-update.sh \fIBUNDLE
Dumps the db, tars the app into /var/backups/dentisys, unpacks the new bundle,
loads its images, copies the files, restarts and checks. If it comes up broken
it prints where the backup is and stops; restoring is still by hand.
.SH EXAMPLES
Install from a bundle:
.PP
.B sudo ./dentisys-install.sh /root/dentisys-1.0.tar.gz
.PP
Restart the stack:
.PP
.B sudo ./dentisys-service.sh restart
.PP
Update:
.PP
.B sudo ./dentisys-update.sh /root/dentisys-1.1.tar.gz
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /opt/dentisys/
App files and release.env.
.TP
.I /etc/dentisys/dentisys.env
Passwords and keys. 600, root.
.TP
.I /var/backups/dentisys/
Backups from dentisys-update.sh.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
fine
.TP
.B 1
something went wrong, the message says what
.SH NOTES
.TP
.B still to write
pause (freeze the app without stopping it), the maintenance page, proper exit
codes, and a checksum check on install and update. Also the bundle is missing
the model files check and the migrations, see the comments in the scripts.
